      "function": { "text": "Honeycomb composite box insulated with 2.5 cm of opacified aerogel; radioisotope heater units, electronics waste heat and survival heaters keep the electronics between −40 and +50 °C while outside temperatures range from 0 to −97 °C.", "sources": ["pds-mer-insthost"] },
