      "category": "avionics",
      "function": { "text": "20 MHz 32-bit RAD6000 processor with 128 MB DRAM and 256 MB flash in a VME card cage; could drive up to 10 of the rover's 35 motors at once.", "sources": ["pds-mer-insthost"] },
      "representation": "none",
